    "number": "O21R21",
    "title": "Simultaneous execution.",
    "content": "The Court may, in its discretion, refuse execution at the same time against the person and property of the judgment-debtor.\n",
    "html": "<article class=\"provision\" data-n=\"O21R21\" data-report=\"Order 21, Rule 21 · The Code of Civil Procedure, 1908\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">21</span>Simultaneous execution.</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Order 21, Rule 21</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>The Court may, in its discretion, refuse execution at the same time against the person and property of the judgment-debtor.</p></div></article>",
    "inner_html": "<div class=\"prov-head\"><h3 class=\"prov-title\"><span class=\"n\">21</span>Simultaneous execution.</h3></div><p class=\"prov-cite\">Order 21, Rule 21</p><div class=\"prov-body\"><p>The Court may, in its discretion, refuse execution at the same time against the person and property of the judgment-debtor.</p></div>"
